 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AWS Systems Manager Incident Manager API (2018-05-10). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Response plans are stored metadata that need no replication set and are shared by every simulator Region, as their ARNs are Region-less: no incident is ever started, so no responder is engaged, no chat channel or SNS topic is notified and no Systems Manager Automation runbook runs. PagerDuty integrations are refused because they contact an external system; UpdateResponsePlan changes the display name, chat channel, engagements and actions only and refuses the incidentTemplate members, and its client token is accepted without replay. Incidents, timeline events, related items, findings, replication sets, resource policies and deletion protection return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501; deleting a missing response plan succeeds as the official operation documents no not-found error.",
  "title": "AWS Systems Manager Incident Manager (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2018-05-10"
 },
